  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Agricultura</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government-to-Government Agreement with Government of Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">A agricultura &#xe9; a ci&#xea;ncia e a pr&#xe1;tica da produ&#xe7;&#xe3;o de alimentos, ra&#xe7;&#xf5;es e fibras (incluindo silvicultura, vida selvagem, pesca, aquicultura e floracultura) e suas rela&#xe7;&#xf5;es com os recursos naturais, processamento, comercializa&#xe7;&#xe3;o, distribui&#xe7;&#xe3;o, utiliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o (incluindo nutri&#xe7;&#xe3;o) e com&#xe9;rcio.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The U.S. Government, through the United States Agency for International Development (USAID), announced new support for bridge construction and road repair in Cabo Delgado. The repairs and construction will allow safer travel between the provinces southern and northern districts, foster economic growth, and improve access for humanitarian assistance. The work will focus on the portion of R698 connecting Montepuez and Mueda, which serves as a key travel and transport corridor for surrounding communities, especially those residents displaced by terrorism and natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
